    {
      "text": "The farm is born",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:22"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Neighbours and youth workers create a small animal paddock in Maximilien Park, in the heart of Brussels.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:27"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "First school programmes",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:35"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The farm welcomes its first school classes. Education around animals, food and the seasons becomes the core of the project.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:40"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Vegetable garden, compost and bees",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:48"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A collective garden, composting area and beehives turn the site into a living example of urban cycles.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:53"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Social employment",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:61"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Internships, work integration and neighbourhood projects give the farm a second, social vocation alongside education.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:66"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "An anchor in the neighbourhood",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:74"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Through the covid years the farm keeps offering open air and calm to a neighbourhood with little greenery.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:79"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Eco-social city farm",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:87"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Over 30,000 visitors a year, dozens of animals, package-free farm produce and a growing network of schools and partners.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:92"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A city farm only succeeds when the neighbourhood calls it their own.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:117"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Anatole leads the non-profit, guards the multi-year plan and keeps the bridge open between the farm, the City of Brussels and our partners.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:122"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Every day starts with a round of the barns — the animals tell you straight away how they are.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:133"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Karim cares for the goats, sheep, chickens and rabbits, follows up with the vet and teaches visitors how to approach an animal calmly.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:138"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Compost is our finest lesson: waste doesn't exist, everything returns to the soil.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:149"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Sofia runs the collective vegetable garden, the composting area and the seed swap with neighbours and schools.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:154"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Every project starts with a question from the neighbourhood, not with a grant form.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:165"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Youssef develops our projects with schools, social organisations and companies, and follows up on files and grants.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/about-content.ts:170"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
