    {
      "text": "Where is the farm?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:54"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The main entrance is at Quai du Batelage 2, 1000 Brussels. There is also a small entrance at Quai de Willebroek 21 (used by birthday families and in winter).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:59"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "How do I get there by public transport?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:67"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The farm is served by tram 51, metro lines 2 and 6 and several bus lines. Full details are on our Accessibility page.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:72"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you welcome Dutch-speaking groups?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:80"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "At the moment we are unfortunately unable to host groups in Dutch. Bookings in that language cannot be accepted.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:85"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "School & non-profit",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:92"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Educational workshops",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:96"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "From what age?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:101",
        "src/lib/hub-content.ts:166"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Most workshops are suitable from age 6. “The animals and our five senses” works for any age.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:105"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "How long does a workshop last?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:113"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Around 120 minutes for one workshop, or a full day for the “Day at the farm” formula (two workshops of your choice).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:118"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "What does a workshop cost?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:126"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "From €250 per group (€350 for “Apple, pear and orchard fruit”, €500 for the full day).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:131"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "How do I book a workshop?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:139"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Directly from each workshop via the Book button. Full details are behind “Read more”.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:144"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Family",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:151",
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:219"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Birthday parties",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:152"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Which birthday formulas do you offer?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:159"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Three formulas: Saturday for children (3h, multipurpose room), Wednesday for children (3h, in the chalet) and Saturday family day (6.5h, multipurpose room).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:164"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "How many children can take part?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:172"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Up to 15 children and 5 adults are included. From the 16th child: €10 per extra child, up to 18 children (for animal welfare reasons).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:177"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there a deposit?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:182"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, a €50 cash deposit on arrival. It is returned if the rooms are left clean and tidy and you leave at the agreed time.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:186"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Is food provided?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:194"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "No, we provide neither food nor drinks: bring your own picnic or snack. For the environment, please avoid single-use decorations and items (paper plates, plastic cups, balloons, confetti…).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:199"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "What is the cancellation policy?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:207"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "We retain €50 in administrative costs. More than 3 weeks before the event: €130 refunded. Within 3 weeks of the event: no refund.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:212"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Camps and internships",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:220"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you run holiday camps for children?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:227"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, throughout the seasons. See the Holiday camps page for dates and registration.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:232"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Can I do a student internship at the farm?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/faq-content.ts:240"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes: animal care, market gardening, beekeeping, administration and HR, maintenance and urban agriculture, activities and project management. A CV is required (cover letter optional).",
