    },
    {
      "text": "Belgian law applies. Any dispute falls under the competent Belgian courts.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-content.ts:197"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Who we are, which data we process and the rights you have under the GDPR.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:195"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Questions about this policy or your data? Write to contact@maximilien.brussels. We reply within 30 days.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:198"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "1. Data controller",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:201"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Maximilien non-profit (ASBL/VZW), Quai du Batelage 2, 1000 Brussels, company number BE 0446.485.159, is the controller of your personal data.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:203"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Privacy contact: contact@maximilien.brussels.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:204"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "2. What we process and why",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:208"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "We only process data you give us yourself, and only for the purpose it was given for.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:209"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Account: name, e-mail address, language and sign-in credentials — to give you access to your bookings, orders and certificates (performance of the contract).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:211"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Bookings (venue rental, school activities, workshops, birthdays): contact details, organisation, date, group size and practical notes — to handle your request and prepare the day (performance of the contract).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:212"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Farm shop orders: name, e-mail, ordered products and pickup slot — to prepare the order and issue the invoice (contract and statutory accounting duty).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:213"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Contact forms: name, e-mail and your message — to answer your question (legitimate interest).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:214"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Academy: first name and score — to issue and verify your certificate (performance of the contract).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:215"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "3. Transactional e-mail",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:219"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Confirmations, reminders, pickup notices and certificates are sent through Brevo (Sendinblue SAS, France), our processor for transactional e-mail.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:221"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Those emails are sent from a separate, isolated subdomain (send.maximilien.site) and contain no read receipts or tracking pixels.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:222"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "These messages are part of your request or order. We send no commercial newsletter without your explicit consent, and every newsletter carries an unsubscribe link.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:223"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "4. Where your data lives",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:227"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Our database runs on Neon in a European region. Photos and documents are stored with Scaleway (France). Payments go through Stripe; we never receive your card details.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:229"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "All processors are bound by a data processing agreement under Article 28 GDPR. We do not move your data outside the European Economic Area without a valid transfer mechanism.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:230"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "5. Cookies and measurement",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:234"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "We set functional cookies only: your session, your language choice and your basket. These require no consent.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:236"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "No advertising cookies, no tracking pixels, no external analytics services and no read receipts in our e-mails.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:237"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "6. Retention periods",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:241"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Contact messages: 2 years maximum.",
