      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "9. Children",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:264"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "For school visits and camps we work with the data of the school or the parent, never with children's accounts. Participant lists are deleted after the activity.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:266"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10. Changes",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:270"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "We update this policy when our services or processors change. The date at the top shows the current version.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:272"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Terms",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:473"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The rules for venue rental, school activities, workshops and farm shop orders.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:475"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A question about these terms or about a booking? Write to contact@maximilien.brussels.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:477"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "1. Scope",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:480"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "These terms apply to every booking, registration and order with Maximilien non-profit, Quai du Batelage 2, 1000 Brussels, BE 0446.485.159.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:482"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Any departure from them applies only when we confirm it in writing. In case of conflict, the written quote prevails over these terms.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:483"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "2. Bookings and confirmation",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:487"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A request through the site is a proposal, not a booking. The booking exists once we confirm it by e-mail with date, time, formula and price.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:489"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "For venue rental and team building a 30% deposit may be requested; the date is only held once we receive it.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:490"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "3. Prices and payment",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:494"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Prices are in euro. As a non-profit we invoice our educational activities without VAT; for rentals and products VAT is shown on the invoice.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:496"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Online payments run through Stripe. Invoices are payable within 14 days unless agreed otherwise.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:497"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "4. Cancellation by you",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:501"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Venue rental, seminars and team building: free up to 30 days ahead; 50% between 30 and 7 days; 100% within 7 days.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:503"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "School activities and workshops: free rescheduling up to 14 days ahead; after that 50%, and the full amount within 48 hours.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:504"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Holiday camps: free up to 21 days ahead; after that a refund only on a medical certificate.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:505"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Cancel by e-mail; the date of your e-mail counts.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:506"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "5. Cancellation or change by us",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:510"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "If an activity cannot take place due to force majeure — extreme weather, animal disease, closure of the park or a technical incident — we propose a new date or refund what you paid in full.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:512"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Our activities largely take place outdoors. In poor weather we adapt the programme; that is not a ground for a refund.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:513"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "6. Farm shop",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:517"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Orders are collected at the farm during the chosen pickup slot. We do not ship.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:519"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Fresh produce depends on the harvest and the animals; if an item is unavailable we offer an alternative or refund it. Uncollected orders are kept for 48 hours after the slot.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:520"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "7. Right of withdrawal",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:524"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "As a consumer you have 14 days to withdraw from an online purchase. This right does not apply to perishable goods (Article VI.53 of the Belgian Code of Economic Law), nor to activities on an agreed date such as a rental, activity or camp.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:526"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "For non-perishable items, an e-mail to contact@maximilien.brussels within 14 days of collection is enough.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:527"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "8. On the farm",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:531"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The farm is a working agricultural site. Follow the team's instructions, stay on the marked paths and do not feed the animals without permission.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:533"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Children remain under the supervision of their parents, teachers or group leaders. For school visits, the school provides the agreed number of supervisors.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:534"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Smoking, alcohol outside prior agreement, drones and dogs are not allowed in the farmyard.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:535"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "9. Liability",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:539"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "We carry civil liability insurance. Our liability is limited to the amount of the booking or order, except in cases of intent, gross negligence or personal injury.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:541"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The hirer is liable for damage caused by their group to the buildings, equipment or animals. Personal belongings remain your own responsibility.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:542"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10. Photography",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:546"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "We sometimes take photographs during activities. Publication only happens with consent; for groups it is requested through the school or organiser. You can object at any time and we remove the image.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:548"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "11. Use of the website",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:552"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Texts, photos, illustrations and the logo remain the property of the non-profit. Reuse without written permission is not allowed; a media kit is available for press.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:554"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "We aim for a permanently available site but cannot guarantee uninterrupted access.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:555"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "12. Complaints and applicable law",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:559"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Report a complaint within 14 days of the activity or delivery at contact@maximilien.brussels. We look for a solution together first.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:561"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Belgian law applies. Disputes fall under the courts of Brussels. Consumers may also use the European ODR platform (ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/legal-pages.ts:562"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": false
    },
