    {
      "text": "Become a volunteer",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:107"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Give the farm a few hours a week or a month — and get a piece of the city, the animals and the people in return.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:108"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Why volunteers?",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:109"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The farm runs on a small team and a large group of volunteers. Without them there would be no cared-for animals, no thriving garden and no warm welcome at the weekend.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:111"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "No experience needed: we teach you everything on site. What counts is showing up regularly, wanting to learn and respecting the animals and people around you.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:112"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Two profiles",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:114"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "We are currently looking for volunteers in two very different roles. Pick the one that suits you.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:116"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Discover this profile",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:117"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Practical",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:118"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Minimum age: 18 (16 when accompanied by an adult).",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:120"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Volunteer insurance is covered by the non-profit.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:121"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Working languages: French and English. Dutch is always welcome — supervision is in French.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:122"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "We start with an introductory chat and a trial day.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:123"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "I want to volunteer",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:125"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Tell us briefly who you are, what you would like to do and when you are available. We will get in touch to meet you.",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:127"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "All volunteer profiles",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:128"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "What you do",
      "sources": [
        "src/lib/volunteer-content.ts:130",
        "src/pages/teambuilding.tsx:83"
      ],
      "germanPhrasePresent": true
    },
